DX Manager Loopback DeX Helper

The Samsung loopback wireless DeX configuration and WFD negotiation are adapted
from ScrcpyDeX (https://github.com/Aureliano021/ScrcpyDex), commit
3e58823000a897300df5cf2c6d4a131d97b28162, specifically
server/src/com/scrcpydex/server/DexActivator.java and wrappers/DisplayManager.java.
