DX Manager hidden-preview integration and session-lifecycle modifications:
Copyright 2026 asyouplz (https://github.com/asyouplz).

DX Manager changes: independent reflection-only helper; no custom capture, input,
or audio implementation; bounded byte-oriented RTSP framing and CSeq correlation;
host heartbeat lease; loopback-only sockets; unique session ownership checks;
refusal to disconnect existing displays; before/after display selection; scoped
cleanup; reproducible build scripts and host-side tests.

This helper is experimental and is not endorsed by Samsung or ScrcpyDeX.
